{"manifest_version": 2, "name": "Tab Limit Guard", "version": "1.0", "description": "Gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n s\u1ed1 tab m\u1edf. Khi v\u01b0\u1ee3t qu\u00e1 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea3nh b\u00e1o (kh\u00f4ng thu th\u1eadp d\u1eef li\u1ec7u).", "permissions": ["tabs", "notifications", "storage"], "background": {"scripts": ["background.js"]}, "browser_specific_settings": {"gecko": {"id": "@tab-limit-guard", "data_collection_permissions": {"required": ["none"]}}}}